        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">macro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"id_gen\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kind</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kindLit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">quote</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kind</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getId</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">ident</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">kindLit</span><span class=\"o\">):</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">kindLit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>perhaps?</p>",
